    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents an obstacle source in the landscape. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_obstacle_source" kindref="compound">ObstacleSource</ref> extends <ref refid="class_path_source" kindref="compound">PathSource</ref> and provides information about obstacles that animals encounter. This can be used to prevent movement or block resources in specific areas. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
